        "original_id": "f42e8ad3-6a57-5eea-94ab-8fda6e685d4c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Unilever Indonesia, Lever Brothers, Margarine Unie, Unilever\n- Places: Indonesia, Angke, Jakarta\n- Products: soap\n- Media: Bringing Up Father (radio)\n\nFacts:\n- In 1930, Lever Brothers merged with Margarine Unie to form Unilever.\n- On December 5, 1933, PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk was established in Indonesia as Lever Zeepfabrieken N.V.\n- Lever Zeepfabrieken N.V. was a subsidiary of Lever Brothers.\n- Lever Zeepfabrieken N.V. initially operated a soap factory at Angke, Jakarta.\n- Lever Brothers was the sponsor of Bringing Up Father (radio).",
